{
  "id": "c04",
  "title": {
    "zh-CN": "第一次身体亲密"
  },
  "start": "c04_n0001",
  "nodes": {
    "c04_n0001": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "暑假第五天的傍晚，特蕾西把一套刚洗过的新内衣叠好，塞进衣柜最上层，又扯了件旧卫衣盖在上面。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0002"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0002": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "黑色，蕾丝，一整套。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0003"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0003": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "这是她初吻之后偷偷买的。那天从店里出来，她拎着纸袋，一路低着头，扫码付款时手指都在抖。买的时候没想太多，就是觉得，要是哪天再近一步，她不想穿着洗得发白的旧内衣面对他。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0004"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0004": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "收银台旁边的小货架上摆着些花花绿绿的小盒子，她扫了一眼，飞快移开视线，出了门。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0005"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0005": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "机械师做事，向来是先有图纸再动手。可这件事，她连图纸都没有，就先买了零件。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0006"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0006": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她盯着衣柜门看了一会儿，忽然觉得有点好笑，甩了甩头。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0007"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0007": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "晚上，卢卡来了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0008"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0008": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "说好一起看她新改的装置设计图，结果图纸摊在床上，谁也没看进去。两人并排坐在床边，肩膀挨着肩膀。她指着图上一处讲了两句，卢卡凑过来看，越凑越近。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0009"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0009": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "然后，就亲上了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0010"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0010": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "从轻碰开始。特蕾西闭着眼，感觉卢卡的手慢慢扶上她的后脑。她心里那根弦又绷起来，又"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0011"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0011": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "啪"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0012"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0012": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "地断掉，这次她没躲，反而仰起头，把嘴张开了一点。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0013"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0013": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "舌头碰到一起的时候，两个人都抖了一下。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0014"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0014": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "好软。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0015"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0015": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "原来深吻是这个感觉。脑子里嗡嗡的，什么都想不了，只记得他的手很烫。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0016"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0016": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "分开的时候，两个人都在喘。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0017"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0017": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西先睁开眼，撞上卢卡的目光，脸"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0018"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0018": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "腾"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0019"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0019": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "地烧起来。她低下头，看见自己卫衣的下摆已经被他无意识地掀起一角。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0020"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0020": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她没把它拉下去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0021"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0021": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0022"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0022": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她喊他。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0023"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0023": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗯。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0024"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0024": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你……想不想看。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0025"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0025": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说完就后悔了，但没改口，只把脸埋得更低，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0026"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0026": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我买了新的。就……今天。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0027"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0027": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡没说话，喉结滚了滚。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0028"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0028": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西没等。她抬手，把卫衣从头顶脱了下来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0029"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0029": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "黑色的蕾丝贴着她的皮肤，胸口那一片白得晃眼。她的乳不算大，被内衣托着，乳肉从蕾丝边微微挤出来一点，前胸的铜色小扣在灯下反着点光，和她平时那身锁芯打扮一样，黑紫里带点亮。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0030"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0030": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡整个人僵住。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0031"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0031": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "好看吗。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0032"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0032": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西问，眼睛看着别处。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0033"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0033": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "……好看。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0034"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0034": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0035"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0035": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "比图纸好看多了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0036"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0036": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西想笑，没笑出来。她勾住他的脖子，把嘴送上去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0037"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0037": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "这一回，她的主动更多了。她一边亲，一边去解卢卡卫衣的扣子，解得很慢，有一颗解了两次才解开。卢卡由着她，等她把他的上衣也脱了，才伸出手，轻轻覆上她的胸。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0038"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0038": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "隔着一层蕾丝，他摸得轻，动作轻得不敢使劲。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0039"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0039": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "可以重一点。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0040"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0040": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0041"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0041": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我受得住。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0042"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0042": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡的手用了点力。乳肉在他掌心里陷下去，又弹回来。特蕾西"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0043"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0043": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "唔"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0044"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0044": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "了一声。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0045"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0045": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他的掌心有茧，磨得她又痒又麻。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0046"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0046": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她伸手到背后，自己解开了内衣的搭扣。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0047"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0047": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "内衣滑下去。没了束缚，她的乳尖挺着，颜色很浅，是淡淡的粉。卢卡低头亲上去，嘴唇含住一边，舌头扫过乳尖。特蕾西仰起脖子，短金发从肩上滑落，手指插进他头发里，不轻不重地抓。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0048"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0048": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗯……哈……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0049"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0049": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0050"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0050": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她喘着气，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0051"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0051": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "下面……也摸摸我。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0052"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0052": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡的手往下，从她的腰滑进牛仔裤的裤腰。隔着内裤，他摸到一片潮热，内裤已经湿了一小块，黏在她身上。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0053"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0053": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西抖了一下，自己把裤子往下褪，连着内裤一起，踢到脚边。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0054"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0054": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她并着腿，又慢慢打开。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0055"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0055": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你……看。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0056"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0056": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她耳尖红得要滴血，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0057"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0057": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我是不是……湿得很厉害。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0058"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0058": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡低头。那里没有毛，小穴微微分开，湿漉漉的，泛着水光。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0059"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0059": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他伸出手指，很轻地碰上去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0060"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0060": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0061"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0061": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "咿"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0062"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0062": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "了一声，大腿内侧绷了一下，又强迫自己放松，抓着他的手腕往下按。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0063"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0063": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "这里。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0064"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0064": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她带着他的手指，按在顶上那颗小小的凸起上，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0065"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0065": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "……卢卡，就这里。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0066"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0066": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "唔……哈啊……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0067"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0067": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡动起来。动作很轻，很慢，带着调试陌生机器的谨慎。水声慢慢响起来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0068"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0068": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "咕啾……咕啾……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0069"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0069": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "重一点……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0070"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0070": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西仰着头，话都说不连贯，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0071"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0071": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我……不疼，可以重……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0072"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0072": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡加了点力，又探进去一根手指。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0073"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0073": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西整个人一缩，又慢慢松开，两条腿彻底张开，脚跟踩在床边。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0074"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0074": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "里面……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0075"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0075": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她喘着，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0076"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0076": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你动一动……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0077"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0077": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他动起来。手指在湿滑的穴里进出，带出黏黏的水。特蕾西的腰跟着他的动作小幅度地摆，嘴里的声音碎得不成句子。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0078"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0078": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "唔……嗯……卢卡……好怪……又好舒服……♡"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0079"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0079": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她抓着他的胳膊，又怕弄疼他，松开，改抓床单。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0080"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0080": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡的手指没停，另一只手还留在她胸前，揉着她的乳。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0081"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0081": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0082"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0082": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他忽然开口，嗓子有点低，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0083"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0083": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我想进去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0084"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0084": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西的动作顿了一下。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0085"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0085": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她睁开眼，看着眼前这个满头汗的人，看着他眼睛里烧着的那点光。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0086"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0086": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "……今天，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0087"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0087": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她小声说，手还搭在他胳膊上，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0088"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0088": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "就到这里好不好。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0089"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0089": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我还……没准备好。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0090"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0090": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她顿了顿，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0091"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0091": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "下次。下次，我提前跟你说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0092"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0092": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡点点头，慢慢把手抽出来，用床头的纸巾擦干净。他没再说什么，只是凑过来，把额头抵着她的额头。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0093"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0093": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "好。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0094"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0094": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0095"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0095": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "不急。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0096"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0096": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西伸手，环住他的脖子，把他拉进怀里，让他的脸埋在她光裸的胸口。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0097"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0097": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "……我买内衣的时候，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0098"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0098": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她忽然说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0099"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0099": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "还看见收银台旁边那些小盒子。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0100"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0100": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "什么。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0101"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c04_n0101": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "就是……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0102"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c04_n0102": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她闭上眼，贴着他，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c04",
        "nodeId": "c04_n0103"
      }
    },
    "c04_n0103": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "算了。下次再告诉你。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0001"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    }
  }
}
